        "kind": "video",
        "project": "galvany",
        "type": "header"
      },
      "title": "Galvany asked what it would take to make their brand feel as** effortless** as their tech.",
      "intro": [
        "GALVANY came to me for a hero video but stayed to reshape how they talk about their business.",
        "They're reinventing heatpump access - think monthly subscription instead of massive upfront costs. Distributed nodes across neighborhoods that optimize each other's efficiency. Good concept, great cause, but hard to visualize.",
        "I took the challenge and the more focused my visual approach became, the more they liked it."
      ],
      "credit": "Comissioned Work | Galvany | 2025/26 | **Creative Direction & Artist  **"
    },
